      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Both v3 and v4 return type(uint256).max as the health factor when an account has no debt (v3 also returns it for an empty user configuration). Integrations that read the health factor must treat max uint as 'no debt', not as a large finite value. (high confidence)",
