      "title": "Measurements and reference values",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Aave v3 health factor is the liquidation-threshold-weighted collateral value divided by total debt value: HF = Σ(collateral_value_i × LT_i) / Σ(debt_value_j). A position with HF below 1 can be liquidated. Aave's own example: $10,000 of ETH at an 80% liquidation threshold with $6,000 of GHO borrowed gives HF 1.333. Aave Governance sets the liquidation threshold per collateral asset. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://aave.com/help/borrowing/liquidations",
          "note": null,
